{
  "id": "1457",
  "title": "What Department Are You From?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2021-11-04",
  "synopsis": "Lucy and Henry learn more about each other and decide how to address each other.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1457/753fd7c7a3b879c34f2521408355c805b4bdff00.mp3?1633681018",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s life in China 6: Maybe I Like Him",
    "chapter": 23,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你是什么系的？\n\n帅哥：我们见面那么多次，还不知道你叫什么名字呢？\n露西：我叫露西。你呢？\n帅哥：我叫Henry。你是中文系的学生？\n露西：是的，我来这里学习中文。你呢？你是什么系的？\n帅哥：我也是中文系的。但是现在我已经不在学校读书了，两年前我已经开始工作了。\n露西：那……你是我的学长，我以后叫你Henry学长，好吗？\n帅哥：没问题，露西小学妹！",
    "traditional": "你是什麼系的？\n\n帥哥：我們見面那麼多次，還不知道你叫什麼名字呢？\n露西：我叫露西。你呢？\n帥哥：我叫Henry。你是中文系的學生？\n露西：是的，我來這裡學習中文。你呢？你是什麼系的？\n帥哥：我也是中文系的。但是現在我已經不在學校讀書了，兩年前我已經開始工作了。\n露西：那……你是我的學長，我以後叫你Henry學長，好嗎？\n帥哥：沒問題，露西小學妹！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What Department Are You From?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "帅哥：我们见面那么多次，还不知道你叫什么名字呢？",
      "traditional": "帥哥：我們見面那麼多次，還不知道你叫什麼名字呢？",
      "pinyin": "shuài gē wǒ men jiàn miàn nà me duō cì hái bù zhī dào nǐ jiào shén me míng zi ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Handsome Guy: We have met so many times, yet I still don’t know your name?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "露西：我叫露西。你呢？",
      "traditional": "露西：我叫露西。你呢？",
      "pinyin": "lù xī wǒ jiào lù xī nǐ ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: I’m Lucy. What about you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "帅哥：我叫Henry。你是中文系的学生？",
      "traditional": "帥哥：我叫Henry。你是中文系的學生？",
      "pinyin": "shuài gē wǒ jiào 2 nǐ shì zhōng wén xì de xué sheng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Handsome Guy: I’m Henry. Are you a student in the Chinese department?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "露西：是的，我来这里学习中文。你呢？你是什么系的？",
      "traditional": "露西：是的，我來這裡學習中文。你呢？你是什麼系的？",
      "pinyin": "lù xī shì de wǒ lái zhè lǐ xué xí zhōng wén nǐ ne nǐ shì shén me xì de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: Yes, I came here to study Chinese. What about you? What department are you from?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "帅哥：我也是中文系的。",
      "traditional": "帥哥：我也是中文系的。",
      "pinyin": "shuài gē wǒ yě shì zhōng wén xì de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "但是现在我已经不在学校读书了，两年前我已经开始工作了。",
      "traditional": "但是現在我已經不在學校讀書了，兩年前我已經開始工作了。",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì xiàn zài wǒ yǐ jīng bú zài xué xiào dú shū le liǎng nián qián wǒ yǐ jīng kāi shǐ gōng zuò le",
      "english": "Handsome Guy: I also am from the Chinese department."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "But I’m no longer studying at school right now. I started working two years ago."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "露西：那……你是我的学长，我以后叫你Henry学长，好吗？",
      "traditional": "露西：那……你是我的學長，我以後叫你Henry學長，好嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lù xī nà nǐ shì wǒ de xué zhǎng wǒ yǐ hòu jiào nǐ 2 xué zhǎng hǎo ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: Then … you are my senior. From now on I will call you “senior Henry”. Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "帅哥：没问题，露西小学妹！",
      "traditional": "帥哥：沒問題，露西小學妹！",
      "pinyin": "shuài gē méi wèn tí lù xī xiǎo xué mèi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Handsome Guy: No worries, “junior Lucy”!"
    }
  ],
